    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16458" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄστᾰχυς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">υος</span>,
			ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάχυς</span>
		with prothetic <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ear of corn,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.148
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.92
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζ́,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Cer.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, etc.: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοστρύχων ἀστάχυες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					1.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Charid.</u>
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bandage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).813
			</span></i>.</div>
